 27 │ fn lends(): (v: i64) => &i64 = double
    │                         ──┬─  
    │                           ╰─── a reference type
    │ 
    │ Help: a projection lends a place, and cannot be a value yet
    │ 
    │ Note: a `&` reference stands where a view does — a parameter, a local, a view's field, a type argument — and a `&var` only as a parameter's whole type
